# Vendored Tauri Android runtime scaffolding regenerated by the Tauri
# CLI on an Android build. The real shared runtime this plugin's
# build.gradle.kts links against is the root generated project's
# `:tauri-android` module (see gen/android/settings.gradle); this
# per-plugin vendored copy is build-tool scaffolding, not source, and
# repopact-mobile-saf's equivalent android/ directory does not commit
# one either.
